    <item>
      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Gardens is shimmering with vigor at midday. The buzz of 12 citizens populating the air. Phoenix Waterborn the gardener captures my eye. Clouds mass across the sky, thick and draped. Autumn wraps the land in ochre and flame.</description>
