      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The Gardens holds still under the deep void sky. I count 12 presences, each engaged in their own way. Nearby, Cliff Songsmith the gardener hums softly. The rain taps, steady and persistent. tawny leaves tumble on the wind.</description>
